        "decision_id": "D000993",
        "disposition": "existing_equivalent",
        "rationale": "After the registered p. 141 range and variance corrections, Stacks proves exactly the finite unpadded assertion on degrees 0 through a. For covariant exact graded connecting functors, positive effaceability implies universality, and under injective effacements universality implies positive effaceability by comparison with the finite restriction of the right-satellite system. Applied to the opposite source, the same lemma gives the contravariant statement with co-effaceability and projective effacements. No enough-injectives, all-degree, exact-satellite, or derived-functor hypothesis is substituted.",
        "review_state": "integrated_source_stacks_and_independent_review",
        "stacks_labels": "homology-lemma-finite-effaceability-universality;homology-lemma-right-satellites-injective-effacements;homology-lemma-graded-connecting-functor-dualities",
        "supersedes": "D000731",
