        "evidence": "Official Part I SHA-256 5A8E5720BC2EF8905BF85F7919C65AC4A87A31CFC854BD77E6B5084C0D2DEBEF, printed p. 141, together with the preceding duality paragraph and the projective dual on printed p. 142. production/p141_fix1/check.json, 6579 bytes, SHA-256 E8936C2A0D376A2B8EC48EB3B1D70DA76927F59112548A168A5589311F2B3658, seals the variance-sensitive corrected source while preserving the diplomatic French. build/v068c3r12/build.json, 92774 bytes, SHA-256 D3E4CD6540E221EE0F6DEEB1E4E87BB4E572328EABA1681356AB71631894D4FD, and qa/v68r32/check.json, 10340 bytes, SHA-256 E34B9BB8180F5A359985A0CA408CC3F2E8B004C9FA6110D9D510F32C8EE91EF9, seal the reader successor and independent visual audit. sem/r14/manifest.json, 6546 bytes, SHA-256 38CEF77FD45EB826F0E38C95194E37824FBFC99B28A14558E7A6490B7DFDF1DE, sem/r14/validation.json, 3918 bytes, SHA-256 F82C9C8C78F386BC1B7F702F37E19AE5EF27065123930FBA21EC76512CD282DE, and qa/v68r33/sem-check.json, 6707 bytes, SHA-256 93B3075BA187F92D9C6E2A09A91E0B8BCD09F3E8A995DD6D82FFA4643406DC38, seal occurrence tohoku:occ:p141:o003 with diplomatic, corrected-French, and English segment hashes FB74732C022BB575D0C18C3A290D011A7F25B4816D261FFB25F3C04E8685E7B7, 25C4E4FCE69BA7010D18B00ADBA1E9E6A4C1BE47E82F6636A57C5C4A1BAF0164, and 862EF7EB7B57062D8035D66BA140E85D62E51761D4CB7C20F678646AEAF804CE.",
